    "duration_raw": "1 minute/level (D)",
    "saving_throw_raw": null,
    "spell_resistance_raw": null,
    "description_raw": "This spell makes your eyes glow and allows you to see alignment auras within 120 feet of you. The effect is similar to that of a detect chaos/evil/good/law spell, but aura sight does not require concentration, and it discerns an aura’s location and power more quickly.\n\nYou know the location and power of all chaotic, evil, good, and lawful auras within your sight. An aura’s power depends on a creature’s Hit Dice or an item’s caster level, as noted in the description of the detect evil spell. If an item or a creature bearing an aura is in line of sight, you can attempt a Knowledge (religion) check to determine the aura’s strength (one check per aura; DC 15 + spell level, or 15 + 1/2 caster level for a non-spell effect).\n\nAura sight can be made permanent with a permanency spell by a caster of 11th level or higher at a cost of 7,500 gp.",
